#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/extension.js:46
msgid "No ambient sensor detected"
msgstr "未检测到环境光传感器"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/extension.js:62
msgid "Auto Brightness"
msgstr "自动亮度"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:13
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "首选项"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:18
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "行为"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:19
msgid "Configure where to show the auto brightness toggle."
msgstr "设置自动亮度开关的显示位置。"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:25
msgid "Override System Brightness Slider Icon"
msgstr "接管系统亮度滑块图标"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:26
msgid "Toggle auto brightness by clicking the icon of the brightness slider."
msgstr "点击亮度滑块的图标即可开关自动亮度。"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:32
msgid "Show in Quick Settings"
msgstr "在快速设置中显示"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:33
msgid "Add a new \"Auto Brightness\" toggle in the quick settings."
msgstr "在快速设置中添加“自动亮度”开关。"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:39
msgid "Enable Initial Auto Brightness"
msgstr "启用初始自动亮度"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:40
msgid ""
"Automatically determine a brightness level when you first start / logon / "
"recover from sleep by enabling auto brightness for a short period of time. "
"This is helpful when you need to frequently move your device to various "
"environments."
msgstr "在开机、登录或从睡眠中恢复时短暂开启自动亮度，以自动确定合适的亮度。适合经常在不同环境间移动设备的情况。"

#: auto-brightness-toggle@sao.studio/prefs.js:64
msgid "Report an Issue"
msgstr "报告问题"
